  "title": "Custom printed greaseproof paper",
  "category": "catering-supplies",
  "status": "published",
  "short_description": "Your logo on the paper that wraps the burger, lines the basket and dresses the board. Greaseproof sheets in 25 × 25 cm, A4 or 30 × 30 cm, in kraft or white.",
  "description": "A greaseproof sheet — 25 × 25 cm, A4 or 30 × 30 cm — printed in a repeat of your logo. Wrap sandwiches and burgers, line trays and boxes, or use it under a grazing board. Choose the size, print colours and paper, then send us your artwork.\n\nUse it to line our [printed burger boxes](/takeaway-packaging/burger-boxes/) and [chicken boxes](/takeaway-packaging/chicken-boxes/), or pair it with [printed bakery bags](/bakery-packaging/bakery-bags/).\n\nYour digital proof and print plates are included in the price. Final specifications are confirmed with your written quote.",
  "benefits": [
    "Up to 4 colour print",
    "Kraft or white",
    "Food-safe greaseproof"
  ],
  "faqs": [
    {
      "q": "Can I use my own design?",
      "a": "Yes. Share your logo or print-ready artwork when requesting a quote. We will confirm the artwork requirements for your chosen item, and you approve a digital proof before anything is printed."
    },
    {
      "q": "What if my artwork is not ready?",
      "a": "You can request a quote first and share your artwork later. Tell us what you have in mind and we can discuss the next steps."
    },
    {
      "q": "Are the prices shown final?",
      "a": "The prices on this page are indicative and exclude VAT, which is added at 20%. Your digital proof and print plates are included, and delivery is free to a single UK mainland address. We confirm everything in a written quote before you commit."
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do other sheet sizes?",
      "a": "Three sizes are priced online: 25 × 25 cm, A4 and 30 × 30 cm. Other sizes and rolls are available on request — use “Request a custom quantity”, tell us the size, and we will quote it."
    },
    {
      "q": "When will my sheets arrive?",
      "a": "As a general guide, allow several weeks from artwork approval to delivery. We will confirm current timing with your quote."
    }
  ],
